                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The dataset represents 200 reviews of ten land and water-based recreation activities (20 reviews per activity) annotated as part of the study reported in Egorova, E. (2021) Using Textual Volunteered Geographic Information to Model Nature-Based Activities: A Case Study from Aotearoa New Zealand.<br>The ten activities include: caving, biking, horse trekking, walking/trekking, diving, kayaking/canoeing, fishing, swimming with mammals, rafting, and sailing.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
